  <!-- Creatures use what they pick up, #588.

       KNOW THE BLAST RADIUS, per charter rule 1. This is a part on `Creature`, so it reaches every
       one of the 849 non-base creature blueprints in the game at once - the same order of reach as
       the Chip Interface merge into `Humanoid`, and it is stated here rather than discovered. It is
       also the first part this fork has merged onto a creature blueprint at all; everything else in
       mod/Scripting/ hangs off an item, the player, or a skill.

       The reach is the feature rather than a side effect. The rule is "a creature that picks
       something up works out whether to use it", and a rule about creatures generally has to be
       attached to creatures generally - the alternative is an authored list, which would be
       inventing the cohort instead of deriving it.

       Vixy_Reequip holds no instance fields, deliberately, because a part on `Creature` would
       otherwise write its layout into every save on every creature. See its remarks, and
       `serializable-shape` in tools/validate_mod.py.

       The part refuses the player, anything with no Brain, and anything with no Combat part, so
       what it actually reaches is smaller than 849 - but the merge is what it is and the number to
       have in mind is the merge's. -->

  <object Name="Creature" Load="Merge">
    <part Name="Vixy_Reequip" />
  </object>
